{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/geist-the-sin-eaters/1188221-what-chronicle-do-you-think-we-ll-get","id":1188221,"title":"What \"Chronicle\" Do You Think We'll Get?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Geist: The Sin-Eaters"],"posts":[{"date":"2018-02-21T10:42:10-08:00","id":1188221,"title":"What \"Chronicle\" Do You Think We'll Get?","content":"Vampire had the strix, Werewolf the idigam, Mage the fallen world, Promethean the firestorm, Changeling the huntsmen, and Hunter the slasher. What do you think Geist will get?<br /> <br /> Four possibilities jump out at me:<br /> <br /> Underworld: The teasers we've seen so far play up the image of the Underworld having an intelligence and malice all its own. Not something sineaters all know, but something a lot of them think and have good reason to think. A chronicle where they have to take sides for and against the Underworld itself could be pretty epic.<br /> <br /> Chthonian: When the idea of Geist second edition was first raised, this seemed to be one of the more popular notions. Things native to the underworld that could threaten both the dead and the living. Most similar to the idigam and strix in general atmosphere.<br /> <br /> Crisis: We now know that in 2e, bound can't form at any given time and place - only when and where there is a lot of ambient death. Except now. Some think it's because the world's population is now high enough that enough people are dying at any given moment without the need for a specific crisis to cause it - others think it portends some kind of catastophe - a chronicle focussed on this question could be pretty moody.<br /> <br /> Krewe: Sineaters don't have a long-running culture, and one of the other popular ideas in the past was a krewe chronicle where the PC's play a part in building one. With the thing about bound not appearing all the time, we now have a reason why now may be the first opportunity for such a culture to develop - which sets up a krewe chronicle pretty well.<br /> <br /> Any other ideas? Or do we already know, and I've missed that?<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/321-sunlessnick","name":"SunlessNick","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1214"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-02-21T10:45:32-08:00","id":1188222,"title":"","content":"Underworld seems most likely. I wouldn't be surprised if the game was more about dealing with the Underworld, similar to werewolves and the Hisil, especially considering aboveworld ghosts tend towards the weak and easy to deal with.<br /> <br /> There's also the mysterious masked ghosts, though.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/886-nofather","name":"nofather","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar886_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11016"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-02-21T10:47:37-08:00","id":1188223,"title":"","content":"I\u2019d definitely bet it\u2019s the Underworld Chronicle, unless that name runs into legal issues with the Underworld film franchise (wouldn\u2019t that be ironic).","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Going by Willow now, or Wil for short. She/Her/Hers.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/269-charlaquin","name":"Charlaquin","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar269_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10831"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-02-21T10:55:28-08:00","id":1188230,"title":"","content":"Aren't Reapers something specific now, and already listed as antagonists who don't like the Bound (thinking that they cheat death)?<br /> <br /> The Reaper Chronicle?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Malkydel: &quot;And the Machine dictated; let there be adequate illumination.&quot;<br /> Yossarian: &quot;And lo, it was optimal.&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7212-vent0","name":"Vent0","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7212_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5184"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-02-21T11:04:53-08:00","id":1188232,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Vent0</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/geist-the-sin-eaters/1188221-what-chronicle-do-you-think-we-ll-get?p=1188230#post1188230\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Aren't Reapers something specific now, and already listed as antagonists who don't like the Bound (thinking that they cheat death)?</div> </div> </div> </div>Huh. That sounds like it could be interesting.<br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/321-sunlessnick","name